message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Physio Galenus: a modular decision support platform for AI-supported physical rehabilitation"
abstract: "Modular web platform that enables therapists to monitor the progress of patients in physical rehabilitation. It integrates a decision support system that automatically adjusts exercise programmes and routines from performance data, streamlining clinical supervision."
